# Local SQLite databases, wherever a command created them: dev.db and
# lexgraph.db (README, RUNBOOK, scripts/demo.sh) from backend/ or the
# repository root, their side files, and backups such as the RUNBOOK's
# `cp dev.db dev.db.bak`. They hold user ids, which are the sign-in
# credentials, so never commit one. (Recreate the demo with scripts/demo.sh.)
*.db
*.db-journal
*.db-wal
*.db-shm
*.db.bak
*.sqlite
*.sqlite3

